  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:-\n\n**(First number + 1)² ×** **2 = Second Number**\n\n__\n \n• 14 : 450 \n\n= (14 + 1)² × 2 = 450\n\n= (15)² × 2 = 450\n\n= 225 × 2 = 450\n\n= 450 = 450\n\nSimilarly,\n\n \n• **18 : 722**\n\n**= (18 + 1)2 × 2 = 722**\n\n**= (19)2 × 2 = 722**\n\n**= 361 × 2 = 722**\n\n**= 722 = 722**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\".**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] Alternate Method__**\n\n**First number × ((First number + 2) × 2) + 2 = Second number.**\n\nBy using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8753c351700ea22fc135d514c6dcb73b8de36891e0ea4a52464e4e24a326cd2e.png] \n\n__\n \n• 14 : 450 \n\n= 14 × (**(14 + 2)**__ × 2) + 2\n\n= 14 × __**(16 × 2)**__ + 2\n\n= __**14 × 32**__ + 2\n\n= **448 + 2**\n\n= 450\n\nSimilarly,\n\n__\n \n• 18 : 722\n\n= 18 × (**(18 + 2)**__ × 2) + 2\n\n= 18 × __**(20 × 2)**__ + 2\n\n= __**18 × 40**__ + 2\n\n= **720 + 2**\n\n= **722**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"18 : 722\".**",
